{"game": "redfall", "language": "english", "appid": 1294810, "month": "2023-12", "window": 4, "start_date": 1703376000, "end_date": 1704067199, "month_true_total": 95, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-09-02 17:05:01 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "154928599", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973393048", "personaname": "cbobb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cbobb/", "num_games_owned": 248, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 113, "last_played": 1705091239, "avatar": "ab5fe4a2b90c88af51d401cd6b8595b29706b148"}, "language": "english", "review": "At the discounted price of 17.49€, Redfall seems like a reasonable buy. However, I wouldn't recommend it at its full price of 70€.\n\nThe game suffers from a limited selection of firearms, accompanied by lackluster enemy AI. Additionally, it's evident that the game lacks optimization, forcing me to set graphics to low settings for a smoother experience, which is disappointing considering it should perform better.\n\nI'm still recommending this game when discounted. However, I'd caution against purchasing it at its full price.", "timestamp_created": 1704059710, "timestamp_updated": 1704059710, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492845773696899414", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "154925706", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008706340", "personaname": "OtherKinders", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AccessGranted/", "num_games_owned": 747, "num_reviews": 136, "playtime_forever": 55, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 55, "last_played": 1704055956, "avatar": "f2eca8d585fdc2d0d5e7abd8c22437506a89642c"}, "language": "english", "review": "tried it during the sale, game is God awful, cant change resolution to match display (4k when other games do go 4k), the NPC's just stand there and do nothing, look worse than some 2004 games on epic settings, no HDR (or at least doesnt work right). It's like they took the worse aspects of Far Cry, Dishonored, and Borderlands, said f*ck it lets try and put a vampire spin on it, and copied L4D gameplay without the fun. I'm about to refund but this is my experience.", "timestamp_created": 1704056677, "timestamp_updated": 1704056677, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473840087652206421", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "154910409", "author": {"steamid": "76561199298955504", "personaname": "Meliodas", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199298955504/", "num_games_owned": 127, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 1300, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 130, "last_played": 1781959004, "avatar": "82e5326a6b33caa659dfd88edce51690f764844b"}, "language": "english", "review": "fix texture not loading  plizzzz 4 gb vram 😭\n\nThe game is good, but it needs to be fixed in terms of graphics for medium and weak cards", "timestamp_created": 1704042265, "timestamp_updated": 1704042400, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.433070838451385498", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 16, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 22, "count": 1}]}, {"recomme