 "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197964798094/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 226, "playtime_forever": 1442, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 319, "last_played": 1714343776, "avatar": "666bc84f5620baddafb592bd15c321215ac7da8d"}, "language": "english", "review": "At least it's better than Alan Wake 2. God, that game is awful\n\nAfter  a hefty discount and several patches, this game is much more enjoyable than Alan Wake 2. Feels like the ret*rded and dumbed-down twin of Dead Island but it's still fun to play.\n \nBut seriously, I paid 69€ for my personal hype-disaster of 2023. Alan Wake 2 is one of the most boring, generic, and lackluster title I've played in a very long time. I uninstalled after 2 hours of gameplay torture.\nSo, in a nutshell:\nBuy this game for 15€\nDON'T buy Alan Wake 2 when it arrives on Steam.\n \nDid I already mention how much Alan Wake 2 s*cks?", "timestamp_created": 1703986372, "timestamp_updated": 1704032060, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.358235716819763184", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 4}]}, {"recommendationid": "154845806", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073971772", "personaname": "L3velDr4in", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/L3velDr4in/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 317, "playtime_forever": 8872, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4804, "last_played": 1780090372, "avatar": "a1f9a19b1ed368c2667d58a9ad1512af74310132"}, "language": "english", "review": "No ads sensitivity :/", "timestamp_created": 1703976109, "timestamp_updated": 1738771415, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.456431567668914795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "rec